      "hizbQuarter": 145,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2900,
      "text": "Do you not see how your Lord extends the shade? If He had willed, He could have made it still. Then We made the sun an indication of it[24].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Furqaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Criterion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 77,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 364,
      "ruku": 314,
      "hizbQuarter": 145,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2901,
      "text": "Then We gradually draw it towards Us [i.e., Then the sun climbs up]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Furqaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Criterion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 77,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 364,
      "ruku": 314,
      "hizbQuarter": 145,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2902,
      "text": "It is He Who has made the night as a garment[25] for you, and made sleep for rest; and has made daytime for returning to life[26].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Furqaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Criterion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 77,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 364,
      "ruku": 314,
      "hizbQuarter": 145,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2903,
      "text": "It is He Who sends the winds as harbingers before His mercy, and We send down from the sky pure water,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Furqaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Criterion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 77,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 364,
      "ruku": 314,
      "hizbQuarter": 145,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2904,
      "text": "so that We may revive therewith a dead land, and quench the thirst of countless beasts and humans We have created.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Furqaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Criterion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 77,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 364,
      "ruku": 314,
      "hizbQuarter": 145,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2905,
      "text": "We distribute it among them so that they may take heed[27], but most people persist in their ingratitude.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Furqaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Criterion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 77,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 364,
      "ruku": 314,
      "hizbQuarter": 145,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2906,
      "text": "If We had willed, We could have sent to each town a warner[28].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Furqaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Criterion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 77,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 364,
      "ruku": 314,
      "hizbQuarter": 145,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2907,
      "text": "So do not obey the disbelievers, but strive against them with this [Qur’an] a great striving.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Furqaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Criterion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 77,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 364,
      "ruku": 314,
      "hizbQuarter": 145,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2908,
      "text": "It is He Who merges the two bodies of water: one fresh and palatable and the other salty and bitter, and He has made between them a barrier and an insurmountable partition[29].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Furqaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Criterion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 77,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 53,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 364,
      "ruku": 314,
      "hizbQuarter": 146,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2909,
      "text": "It is He Who created human beings from water[30], then made between them bonds of kinship and marriage, for your Lord is Most Capable.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Furqaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Criterion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 77,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 54,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 364,
      "ruku": 314,
      "hizbQuarter": 146,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2910,
      "text": "Yet they worship besides Allah that which can neither benefit nor harm them; the disbeliever always collaborates against his Lord[31].",
      "surah": {
